  "scope": [
    "Android withdrawal form, inline quote lifecycle, final approval and result presentation; web, Rust core and vault format unchanged",
    "Single asset-first Send form with explicit Paste, network bottom sheet, exact amount and Max, available balance and fixed review footer",
    "Generic network stays unchosen; first network selection preserves a recipient entered before selection; later switches use chain-scoped drafts",
    "Read-only quote worker coalesces to one running request and one latest pending request; input, wallet, page and freshness checks discard obsolete results",
    "Accepted quote provides pinned asset availability, exact integer units and separate ETH fee reserve; cached availability is labelled Last checked",
    "Max uses full supported precision; ERC-20 token amount is not reduced by the separate ETH network fee",
    "Fee quotes and preparation claims are single-use and expire; successful preparation is revalidated before authentication and broadcast",
    "Explicit Edit, toolbar Back and hardware Back require successful durable cancellation of the exact unsigned prepared intent",
    "Final review exposes exact amount, complete recipient, selected network and inspectable token contract and fee budget",
    "Submission acknowledgment is awaiting confirmation; uncertain or signed outcomes retain recovery through Activity and never imply finality",
    "Secure bottom sheets dismiss on pause or navigation; explicit edge-to-edge ownership handles system bars, cutouts and keyboard insets",
    "Existing optional authentication, concealed recovery phrase, Coinbase price freshness and transaction durability are preserved"
  ],
